(text "ASSEMBLY: C14,C27,R21,C23 mount on B.Cu; all other carrier components mount on F.Cu.\nFit two 1x9 female sockets on carrier; solder male headers to Tiny, then plug it in.\nPreserve the blank masked area beneath Tiny underside test pads; no exposed vias/pads there.\nFour copper layers; In1 GND reference. Passives remain 0805 or larger; allow two-sided assembly.\nADS1296 TQFP64 remains 0.5mm pitch: use magnification,flux and bridge inspection." (at 20 177 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "81485b85-17bc-5381-8eb7-c47997d3ca10"))
(text "CapFix: C22,C10,C14,C20,C27 meet <=2mm; R21 meets <=3mm to the specified U1 pad centres.\nThese are independently checked XY centre distances; underside placement adds board thickness and vias.\nSee SIX_TARGET_VERIFICATION.json for final-board hash,trace lengths,series vias and local ground returns.\nValues and footprints retained. Bench prototype: no physical noise,RLD-stability or USB test performed." (at 20 219 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3bff6847-b104-5554-a4f4-c5d5a2e725e2"))
